		IncludesAlso:
			"This class also includes:\\n- activities of captive financial institutions involved in intragroup lending\\n- brass plate companies engaged in raising funds and remitting those funds to their parent, i.e. units that are owned (directly or indirectly) by a non-resident unit, of which a large part of the balance sheet consists of claims and liabilities towards non-resident units, and that have few or no employees and little or no physical presence in the jurisdiction of incorporation",
